# After S-944, patterns are SurfaceNode dispatched in match_pattern. A lambda expression
# in pattern position (SurfaceExpression::Fn) hits the `_ => Err(...)` catch-all arm
# and produces "not a valid pattern: [fn ...]". This is a runtime eval error.
[
  word: "hello"
  result: [match word
    [fn [let x] [> [str-length x] 3]]: "long"
    ...:                                "short"]
]
---
%.result
=== error
not a valid pattern: [fn ...]
